# tuning: none (ANNIE's WCSim reads macros/tuning_parameters.mac of its build directory itself)
# ANNIE as ANNIE's WCSim builds it (ANNIEsoft/WCSim annie e88314b: its default ANNIEp2v2 geometry, the realistic tank
# PMT content, constructed by WCSim's main at initialisation; macros/tuning_parameters.mac of the build directory, read by WCSim's
# main), for photon-transport references. This WCSim has no DoNotApplyQE: the QE is kept as ANNIE runs it
# (Multi_Tank_Types, refs/README.md gives the net per-tube probability lumen applies); no collection efficiency, no
# dark noise in any element, every true hit kept (NoTrigger). Sources follow (run.sh).
/run/verbose 0
/tracking/verbose 0
/hits/verbose 0
/WCSim/PMTQEMethod Multi_Tank_Types
/WCSim/LAPPDQEMethod Multi_Tank_Types
/WCSim/PMTCollEff off
/control/execute macros/annie_daq.mac
/DAQ/SetDetectorElement tank
/DAQ/Trigger NoTrigger
/DarkRate/SetDetectorElement tank
/DarkRate/SetDarkRate 0 kHz
/DarkRate/SetDetectorElement mrd
/DarkRate/SetDarkRate 0 kHz
/DarkRate/SetDetectorElement facc
/DarkRate/SetDarkRate 0 kHz
